        "summary": "Two-page invoice #950658-1 from KMSP (Fox 9) to Assembly Media, Attention: Accounts Payable, for broadcast advertising purchased by Michael Bloomberg 2020, Inc. The invoice, dated 02/23/20 for the period 01/27/20\u201302/21/20, itemizes 18 aired political candidate spots on channel 9 with air dates, times, and rates. Totals: gross $5,625.00, agency commission $843.75, net amount due $4,781.25 with 30-day payment terms."
