        "summary": "Two-page broadcast television confirmation contract (#4251728) from WZTV Nashville (Fox 17), entered 02/20/20, for the Amy Klobuchar for President-D campaign placed through agency Groundswell Public Strategies. It schedules 41 spots running 02/21/20\u201302/25/20 in news, spot, and prime dayparts (e.g., Fox 17 This Morning, Judge Judy, Fox 17 News at 9), with a grand total of $9,110.00, a 15% commission of $1,366.50, and a net total of $7,743.50. The document includes a signature block for agency/advertiser and station acceptance and references Standard Advertiser Terms and Conditions; it was printed 02/24/20."
      },
