        ],
        "summary": "A broadcast advertising invoice from KPTH (Fox 44), Dakota Dunes, SD, dated 02/09/20 (invoice #1336165-2), issued to Buying Time, LLC in Washington, DC for the Tom Steyer for President campaign. It bills one :30 spot aired 02/03/20 at 10:24 AM during 'The Doctors' with a gross total of $40.00, agency commission of $6.00, and net amount due of $34.00, with 30-day payment terms and remittance to Sinclair Broadcast Group."
