        "summary": "A four-page broadcast television invoice (Invoice # 220018567, Invoice Date 03/01/20, Invoice Period 02/24/20\u201302/25/20) from KCNC-TV (CBS 4, Denver) to the advertiser Bernie 2020, with billing directed to the agency Bluewest Media. It itemizes 23 aired spots placed during the Order Flight 02/19/20\u201302/25/20 (Order # 277809) in programs such as local news, CBS This Morning, and Dr. Phil, with a Gross Total of $10,910.00, Agency Commission of $1,636.50, and Net Amount Due of $9,273.50 under 30-day payment terms."
